File formats
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The DXF reader (src/formats/dxf.js) was written from the publicly published
DXF reference. No vendor software was decompiled, disassembled or copied.
"DXF" and "DGN" are used only to name the file formats this app opens.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not bundled
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Playwright (Apache-2.0) is used only to run the end-to-end tests and to render
the PNG app icons; it is not part of the app and is not redistributed.
